<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - American Federal raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - American Federal raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robinson-Humphrey Co Inc said it raised the near-term rating on American Federal Bank FSB to buy from market perform.</p>
<p>-- said kept the long-term rating as a buy.</p>
<p>-- American Federal gained 1/2 to 28 in early morning trading.</p>
</text>
